{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And he shall pursue after them.</b> When he goes out against them to battle, they will flee and he will pursue them, and the aggression falls upon him and upon his people — for they would not let them return — and they are not liable to return to them what they had borrowed, since after all they left them their houses, their fields, and their vessels." "<b>And the Egyptians shall know that I am YHWH.</b>"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:42.108288180Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}